# Ghidra's P-code got this wrong (ADR 0014): the store ran unconditionally.
title: vaddgt and vstrgt in an IT block are skipped when gt fails
ref: A8.8 IT; A2.5.2 ITSTATE: each instruction in the block is conditional on its own condition; A8.8 VADD (floating-point), VSTR

[code]
0028        cmp r0, #0
c4bf        itt gt
30ee201a    vaddgt.f32 s2, s0, s1
81ed001a    vstrgt s2, [r1]
7047        bx lr

[in]
r0 = 0
r1 = DATA
s0 = f32:1.5
s1 = f32:2.25
word DATA = 0x12345678

[out]
flags = nZCv
word DATA = 0x12345678
